            "review_title": "Review at Indian Dhaba Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Chak D\n35 contributions\n0\nDelicious food\nJul 2026 • Friends\nAbsolutely amazing experience at INDIAN DHABA! The food is authentic, fresh, and full of rich Indian flavors. Every dish was perfectly cooked, especially the butter chicken, biryani, and garlic naan. The staff were friendly, attentive, and made us feel very welcome.\n\nThe restaurant is clean, comfortable, and has a great atmosphere for families and friends. If you’re looking for delicious Indian food in Vietnam, INDIAN DHABA is a must-visit. Highly recommended—I’ll definitely be coming back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 12, 2026",
